# Code-review-graph (ticket-solution)

Namespace MCP: `code-review-graph-ticket` (Cursor: `user-code-review-graph-ticket`; Claude Code: `code-review-graph-ticket`). Graph khác: FE=`code-review-graph-fe`, SGAMES=`code-review-graph-sgames` (Cursor). Server BE `code-review-graph` (portal-be) đã gỡ — path không còn tồn tại.

Daemon watch alias `ticket-solution` → `/Users/admin/SideProject/ticket-solution/main`; DB `.code-review-graph/graph.db` (gitignored) chỉ nằm ở checkout `main`, **worktree Orca không có graph riêng** — MCP luôn trỏ về `main`. Loại file khỏi graph bằng `.code-review-graphignore` (đã loại `.venv*`). Hooks `sessionStart` / `beforeSubmitPrompt` auto-update — agent vẫn **verify** bước 1.

## Readiness gate (bắt buộc)

Trước **coding / explore / impact / review**:

1. `list_graph_stats_tool`
2. Trống / stale / lỗi MCP → `build_or_update_graph_tool` (incremental; `full_rebuild` khi thiếu node rõ)
3. Sau ready → `semantic_search_nodes_tool` / `query_graph_tool` / `get_impact_radius_tool` / `detect_changes_tool`
4. **Không** Grep/broad-scan thay graph khi MCP available

**Exempt:** docs/rules Q&A thuần; MCP thật sự unavailable (ghi limitation → fallback `rg`/source/Read).

## Tool flow

1. **Symbols first** — PascalCase (`TicketService`, `CheckInController`), không URL slug
2. `semantic_search_nodes_tool(query=Symbol)` → ambiguous thì `qualified_name`
3. `query_graph_tool` (`callees_of` / `callers_of` / `imports_of` / `tests_for`) hoặc `get_impact_radius_tool` / `get_affected_flows_tool`
4. **lean-ctx** cho routes/docs/literals CRG không index; `ctx_read` ladder: map → signatures → lines → anchored → full
5. Source wins nếu graph ≠ source; không đổi code chỉ từ graph

## Khi ưu tiên graph

| Nhu cầu | Tool |
| -------- | ----- |
| Explore | `semantic_search_nodes_tool`, `query_graph_tool` |
| Impact | `get_impact_radius_tool`, `get_affected_flows_tool` |
| Review | `detect_changes_tool`, `get_review_context_tool` |
| Architecture | `get_architecture_overview_tool`, `list_communities_tool` |

Review: `query_graph_tool` pattern `tests_for` cho coverage.
